#!/usr/bin/python3
"""Authenticated repository worker for the Section 9 fresh compiler profile.

The image-owned bootstrap executes these reviewed bytes from a sealed memfd.
This file deliberately imports only the Python standard library: no repository
module is read before both source roots have been authenticated and copied into
the worker-owned private root.
"""

